  3	//! This module intentionally takes a root, locator, and runner rather than a
  4	//! [`Workspace`]. A workspace caches parsed manifests and config for a normal
  5	//! command invocation; accepting one here would make a previously observed
  6	//! graph look current after the filesystem changed.
