docs/projects/SPEC-SELF-RELEASE-LIFECYCLE.json:6:    "GitHub Actions, GitHub Releases, artifact attestations",
docs/projects/SPEC-SELF-RELEASE-LIFECYCLE.json:32:        "Classify existing branch work as retained foundations (no approval, dependency repair, terminality failure) versus interim-only work (unconsumed profiles and workflow-owned recovery provenance).",
docs/projects/SPEC-SELF-RELEASE-LIFECYCLE.json:33:        "Delete or explicitly mark every unconsumed release-profile and workflow-only recovery contract as interim before the canonical implementation starts; do not leave two semantic authorities.",
